 <h3><u>Kar de ghaazi karam</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Karde ghazi karde maula tu karde ghazi karam<br> karde maula karde ghazi tu karde maula karam.. karam</p> 
  <p>Saani nayi hai koi, ghaazi teri wafa da..(2)<br> duniya nu winj padhaya, tu yu sabak wafa da<br> chaukhat te teri saare..(2)<br> sar hogaye nikham<br> karde ghaazi karam.. karam karam..(2)<br> weeran da wastayi..(2) rakhle mera bharam<br> karde ghaazi karam.. karam karam..(2)</p> 
  <p>1. Mangda dua te kaabe di chhat pe aawe tu<br> Shaane husain sab nu fir'a sun'awe tu<br> zakir tu aap howe..(2) mimbar howe haram<br> karde ghaazi karam.. karam karam..(2)</p> 
  <p>2. Aulaad, rizq, ghurbat, dardan de haal ne<br> lakkha sawaliya de, lakkha sawaal ne<br> sab da jawab jag te..(2) ikko tera alam<br> karde ghaazi karam.. karam karam..(2)</p> 
  <p>3. Mai naam sayyada de putra de jadd lawaa<br> maula hasan husain te mohsin jaga gawaa<br> ghaazi da naam leke..(2) karnawa gal khatam<br> karde ghaazi karam.. karam karam..(2)</p> 
  <p>4. Ae qibla e wafa, aye mukhtar e do jahaan<br> hai oona faasla safa marwa de darmiyan<br> jinna e door rozae..(2) sheh to tera haram<br> karde ghaazi karam.. karam karam..(2)</p> 
  <p>5. Haider de ikhteyaar te fatwe lagawe jo<br> behad di apni aql nal hadda ban'awe jo<br> karde qalam samet tu ode hattha nu qalam<br> karde ghaazi karam.. karam karam..(2)</p> 
  <p>6. Tera maqaam jagnu aabid dasa gaya<br> zakir ne jinne waari abbas aakheya<br> uth daasi maula aabid..(2) har waari rab qasam<br> karde ghaazi karam.. karam karam..(2)</p> 
  <p>7. Akbar di aarzu we is shaan nal maraa<br> mai jend wele maula saawaa khatam kara<br> meri jabeen howe..(2) howe tere qadam<br> karde ghaazi karam.. karam karam..(2)</p> 
  <p>Maulaaa ghaazi..(3)</p> 
